  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759170,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 100,000 Pyramid (Commodore 64) - A Game of Words and Wit!\n\nStep into the fast-paced world of the classic TV game show with *100,000 Pyramid* for the Commodore 64! This early adaptation captures the thrill of the original, challenging you and a friend to climb the pyramid of words and reach the ultimate prize.\n\nThe gameplay is simple yet addictive. Choose a category – from \"Things That Are Red\" to countless others – and race against the clock to have your partner guess the hidden words using only clever clues.  Careful! You can't say the word itself!  Strategic clue-giving and quick thinking are essential to success.\n\nExperience the tension of the TV show as you strive to earn points and ascend the pyramid. For a solo challenge, a single-player mode offers a different twist, testing your clue-writing skills as you type hints for a computer-controlled opponent.  *100,000 Pyramid* is a perfect blend of wordplay, strategy, and competitive fun – a must-have for any Commodore 64 enthusiast!"
    },
